==Battleground==
*1 [[Large White Ball]] (10,000%) spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Large White Ball]] (10,000%) spawns after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] (1,000%) spawns after 45.33 seconds<sup>1,360f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] (1,000%) spawns after 46.33 seconds<sup>1,390f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Large White Ball]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Large White Ball]]s (10,000%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Large White Ball]]s (10,000%) spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Large Red Ball]]s (1,000%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Large Red Ball]]s (1,000%) spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Large Red Ball]]s (1,000%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Large White Ball]]s (10,000%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Large Red Ball]]s (1,000%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**4 [[Large White Ball]]s (10,000%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The overwhelming number of balls can be taken care of relatively easily by strong Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. Even if you don't own either, the stage supplies you with enough cash to spam expensive attackers like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], alongside [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]].

